; =====================================================
; BitSetter - Clear Tool Reference
; For Shapeoko 5 PRO 2x2 with HDZ
; =====================================================
; Clears the stored tool reference.
; Run "Change Tool" again to set a new reference.
; =====================================================

%global.toolReferenceSet = 0
%global.toolReferenceMZ = 0

(msg, Tool reference cleared. Run Change Tool to set new reference.)
